## Prerequisites and checks

O012-P1 / item_version 1: O002 is needed because OLS normal-equation orthogonality explains partialling out. Prompt: With full regressor columns1,t,x, which residual inner products vanish? Key: Σe=0, Σte=0, Σxe=0 at OLS full rank. Pass requires the keyed mechanism and qualification; partial means an omitted step; fail means a conflicting mechanism. Adequate committed evidence under a compatible criterion permits skipping this diagnostic. Otherwise repair through [[03_Agents/2026_2027/Winter_Semester/Econometrics_II/lessons/O002.md#Outcome and conditions]] before continuing.

